7
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:22,730
But the main focus is
going to be discussing the

8
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:25,470
distinguishing characteristics
of the different microbes

9
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:33,410
that cause UTIs urinary
tract infections are one

10
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:37,370
of the most common types
of infection with over half

11
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:40,090
of all adult women having
at least one some time

12
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:43,550
in their life now they could
basically affect anyone

13
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:46,290
of any age but they're seen
much more frequently in

14
00:00:46,290 --> 00:00:49,710
adult females the infections
can occur in both the

15
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:53,810
lower and upper urinary
tract and pathogenesis of a

16
00:00:53,810 --> 00:00:57,690
UTI typically begins with
colonization of the external

17
00:00:57,690 --> 00:01:00,590
opening of the
genitourinary tract by some

18
00:01:00,590 --> 00:01:05,090
uropathogen, usually from
the fecal flora, or maybe

19
00:01:05,090 --> 00:01:08,110
